[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: REQ-API-002 · Acceptance criteria

[GRAMMAR]
IMPORT_FROM_FILE: @requirements

[ACCEPTANCE_CRITERION]
UID: REQ-API-002.AC-1
STATEMENT: Every rejected calculation request is answered with HTTP status 400, Content-Type application/json, and a JSON object with exactly the fields "error" and "message", both JSON strings.
VERIF_LEVELS: integration, system
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: REQ-API-002

[ACCEPTANCE_CRITERION]
UID: REQ-API-002.AC-2
STATEMENT: The "message" field of an error response is not empty.
VERIF_LEVELS: integration, system
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: REQ-API-002

[ACCEPTANCE_CRITERION]
UID: REQ-API-002.AC-3
STATEMENT: A request body that is not valid JSON, or is valid JSON but not a JSON object, is rejected with the error code MALFORMED_REQUEST.
VERIF_LEVELS: integration, system
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: REQ-API-002

[ACCEPTANCE_CRITERION]
UID: REQ-API-002.AC-4
STATEMENT: An error response contains no "result" field.
VERIF_LEVELS: integration, system
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: REQ-API-002
